The second function (`findLongestPalindrome`) takes in a string as input and finds the longest palindrome within that string. It considers every possible substring in the input string and checks if it is a palindrome. If a palindrome is found, it checks if its length is greater than the length of the current longest palindrome. If it is, the current longest palindrome is updated with the new one.

